ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi164: Single ADVANCED_FACE on PLANE in CLOSED_SHELL; outer EDGE_LOOP has 4 LINE edges forming a diamond, listed in shuffled order [E2, E0, E3, E1] IS the defect; E0 (0,5,0)→(5,10,0), E1 (5,0,0)→(10,5,0), E2 (10,5,0)→(5,10,0), E3 (5,10,0)→(5,0,0); correct order is E0, E2 (reversed), E3, E1 (reversed) etc.; shuffled EDGE_LOOP [E2,E0,E3,E1] creates endpoint-matching cycle in FixReorder dependency graph — E0-end = E2-end = (5,10,0) and E3 connects them, creating cyclic dependency IS the mechanism; EDGE_LOOP IS wired into FACE_OUTER_BOUND → ADVANCED_FACE in CLOSED_SHELL — never orphaned */
HEADER;
FILE_DESCRIPTION(('Twi164'),'2;1');
